OL,3,GNEWSAPrincess Anne unveils plaque for
OL,4,AUK's first female neurosurgeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess Royal has visited the
OL,7,FWalton Centre to unveil a plaque
OL,8,Fhonouring a pioneering Cheshire woman
OL,9,Fwho became the UK's first female
OL,10,Fneurosurgeon.
OL,12,FPrincess Anne unveiled a plaque to
OL,13,FDiana Beck, who was born in Chester in
OL,14,F1902, at the Walton Centre in
OL,15,FLiverpool.
OL,17,FThe hospital is also honouring the
OL,18,Fsurgeon by renaming its theatre to The
OL,19,FBeck Theatre Department.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
